model cmp01
  tally 1
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-01-31
  note "Composed case: the union of MP-09 (Düsseldorfer Tabelle 2026, Teil C Beispiel), MP-11 restricted to the § 40 Exemple (key ex40 of foyer), and example (27) of MP-15, with the NBP table A rate of 2025-12-31 and the composition's facts."
  note "Items are copied from the three models unchanged, except: MP-11's income is fr_income, since MP-09 also has an income; MP-15's example key is dropped (only (27) is used), and its amounts are money PLN, since the composition reads them as złoty and the pays move money."
  note "Eleven people are the keys of person. The composition's payments are pays dated January 2026 (an imprecise date): each child's maintenance from U's euro account to the child's, and each debt of (27) from the debtor's złoty account to the creditor's. Their law date is the month's first day, 2026-01-01 (LANGUAGE §4.3), and each counts whole in a flows over January (§4.4)."
  note "Known dates follow LANGUAGE §4.5: law from its publication; the examples' facts, the composition's facts and the modeller's assumption are stipulations, known from the model's start, 2026-01-01. So every version the January pays read is known by their date, and none is a correction."
  note "MP-11's defs are evaluated at the start of the income year (at start_of(income_year[f])), so the barème for revenus 2025 applies."

source bgb "Bürgerliches Gesetzbuch §§ 1603, 1609, 1612a, 1612b (gesetze-im-internet.de)" at "https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/bgb/__1609.html"
source boi_liq_20_10 "BOI-IR-LIQ-20-10, IR - Liquidation - Détermination de l'impôt brut, version du 07/04/2026" at "https://bofip.impots.gouv.fr/bofip/2491-PGP.html/identifiant=BOI-IR-LIQ-20-10-20260407"
source boi_liq_20_20_20 "BOI-IR-LIQ-20-20-20, IR - Liquidation - Plafonnement des effets du quotient familial, version en vigueur du 07/04/2026" at "https://bofip.impots.gouv.fr/bofip/2494-PGP.html/identifiant=BOI-IR-LIQ-20-20-20-20260407"
source boi_liq_20_20_40 "BOI-IR-LIQ-20-20-40, IR - Liquidation - Autres corrections, IV. Règles d'arrondissement, version du 04/07/2018" at "https://bofip.impots.gouv.fr/bofip/2496-PGP.html/identifiant=BOI-IR-LIQ-20-20-40-20180704"
source composition "CMP-01 composition (tmp/verification/sources/CMP.md): the stipulated facts that join the three examples; not a published document"
source dgfip_brochure "Brochure pratique IR 2026 (revenus 2025), chapitre Calcul de l'impôt, pp. 369-382, DGFiP" at "https://www.impots.gouv.fr/www2/fichiers/documentation/brochure/ir_2026/pdf_som/21-calcul_impot_369a382.pdf"
source loi_2026_103 "Loi n° 2026-103 du 19 février 2026 de finances pour 2026, art. 4, I-A et B (CGI art. 197, I), published in the Journal officiel of 20 February 2026; the text was not fetched (Légifrance HTTP 403), its figures are read where the BOFiP reprints them"
source modeller "The modeller's own assumptions, each stated with its reason"
source muvaendv_7 "Siebte Verordnung zur Änderung der Mindestunterhaltsverordnung vom 15. November 2024 (BGBl. 2024 I Nr. 359, published 21 November 2024), Art. 1; read in the consolidated MinUhV § 1 (gesetze-im-internet.de/minuhv/__1.html)" at "https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/minuhv/__1.html"
source nbp_api_rate "NBP Web API, exchange rate of EUR, table A, 2025-12-31" at "https://api.nbp.pl/api/exchangerates/rates/a/eur/2025-12-31/?format=json"
source nbp_api_table "NBP Web API, table A of 2025-12-31 (table endpoint)" at "https://api.nbp.pl/api/exchangerates/tables/a/2025-12-31/?format=json"
source nbp_xml "NBP, Tabela kursów typ A, numer 251/A/NBP/2025, data publikacji 2025-12-31 (archive XML file)" at "https://static.nbp.pl/dane/kursy/xml/a251z251231.xml"
source olg_dt2026 "Düsseldorfer Tabelle, Stand: 01.01.2026 (Tabelle, Anmerkungen A–E, Anhang: Tabelle Zahlbeträge), OLG Düsseldorf" at "https://www.olg-duesseldorf.nrw.de/infos/Duesseldorfer_Tabelle/Tabelle-2026/DT_2026.pdf"
source stefeg "Steuerfortentwicklungsgesetz (SteFeG) vom 23. Dezember 2024 (BGBl. 2024 I Nr. 449, ausgegeben 30. Dezember 2024), Art. 2 (§ 66 Abs. 1 EStG from 1 January 2026); read in the consolidated EStG § 66 (gesetze-im-internet.de/estg/__66.html)" at "https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/estg/__66.html"
source verhoeff "Tom Verhoeff, Settling Multiple Debts Efficiently: An Invitation to Computing Science, Informatics in Education, Vol. 3, No. 1 (2004), pp. 105-126, doi:10.15388/infedu.2004.08" at "https://infedu.vu.lt/journal/INFEDU/article/612/file/pdf"

axis cmp_spouses
  a_is_f2 "the French spouse fr_a is friend 2 and fr_b is friend 3 (the composition does not say)"
  b_is_f2 "the French spouse fr_b is friend 2 and fr_a is friend 3"

axis dt_cut_round
  nearest "each child's share rounded half up to the cent, independently (the source states no rule)"
  largest_rem "each share rounded down to the cent, the leftover cents to the largest remainders (the source states no rule)"

axis dt_u_work
  employed "U is in work (erwerbstätig), Anm. A.VII; the source does not state it"
  not_employed "U is not in work (nicht erwerbstätig), Anm. A.VII"

axis fr_comp_order
  example "the complementary reduction cap is added to the capped benefit in the second term, then the terms are compared (§ 185 Exemple)"
  bofip_text "the terms are compared with the general cap only; the complementary reduction is the excess of the capped tax over the first term, capped, and comes off the tax after capping (§ 140, § 150, § 170)"

index agegroup = [a0_5, a6_11, a12_17, a18]

index child = [k1, k2, k3]

index foyer = [ex40]

index friend = [f0, f1, f2, f3]

index incgroup = [g1, g2, g3, g4, g5, g6, g7, g8, g9, g10, g11, g12, g13, g14, g15]

index parts_col = [p2, p2_5, p3, p3_5, p4, p4_5, p5]

index person = [de_u, de_e, de_k1, de_k2, de_k3, fr_a, fr_b, fr_c1, fr_c2, fr_c3, fr_c4]

place eur[p in person]: account EUR

place pln[p in person]: account PLN

input base_parts: num

input brochure_row[n in parts_col]: money EUR
  note "the brochure's direct-reading barème for a married couple, one row of revenu imposable, by number of parts; it includes the plafonnement and the décote"

input cap_comp: money EUR

input cap_half: money EUR

input child_age[c in child]: int question "Wie alt ist das Kind im maßgeblichen Monat?"

input child_person[c in child]: key person

input comp_halves[f in foyer]: int
  note "the half-parts that open the réduction d'impôt complémentaire (CGI art. 197, I-2 al. 4)"

input debts_on: date

input dt_amount[g in incgroup, a in agegroup]: money EUR

input estg_kindergeld: money EUR

input eur_pln: num PLN/EUR
  note "the NBP table A average rate (kurs średni) of EUR"

input eur_pln_table: num PLN/EUR

input eur_pln_xml: num PLN/EUR

input flow_month: month
  note "the month questions 4 and 5 ask about"

input fr_income[f in foyer]: money EUR question "Quel est le revenu net imposable du foyer?"

input friend_of[o in cmp_spouses, i in friend]: key person

input in_school[c in child]: bool question "Befindet sich das volljährige Kind in der allgemeinen Schulausbildung?"

input income: money EUR question "Wie hoch ist das bereinigte Nettoeinkommen des Unterhaltspflichtigen im Monat?"

input income_year[f in foyer]: year

input kindergeld: money EUR

input lives_with_parent[c in child]: bool question "Lebt das Kind im Haushalt der Eltern oder eines Elternteils?"

input maint_on: date

input minuhv_amount[a in agegroup]: money EUR

input owe[i in friend, j in friend]: money PLN
  note "Verhoeff's a i,j: the amount friend i owes friend j; the diagonal is not defined"

input parts[f in foyer]: num question "Combien de parts de quotient familial compte le foyer?"

input selbstbehalt[w in dt_u_work]: money EUR

input unmarried[c in child]: bool question "Ist das volljährige Kind unverheiratet?"

band bareme(x: num EUR): num
  note "the barème of CGI art. 197, I-1: the marginal rate of each tranche of the quotient, per part; read with marginal()"

band dt_age(n: int): key agegroup
  note "Altersstufen of the table, page 1"

band dt_group(x: money EUR): key incgroup
  note "Einkommensgruppen of the table, page 1. Bands are printed in whole euros; an income with cents above a printed upper bound is read as the next group."

def adult_balance[p in person]: money PLN = adult_owes[p] - adult_owed[p]

def adult_owed[p in person]: money PLN = sum(i in friend where friend_person[i] = p: owed_total[i])

def adult_owes[p in person]: money PLN = sum(i in friend where friend_person[i] = p: owes_total[i])

def balance[i in friend]: money PLN
  note "(8): b i = p i - r i; positive means friend i must pay others"
  rule base v verhoeff_2004 = owes_total[i] - owed_total[i]

def balance_sum: money PLN = sum(i in friend: balance[i])

def benefit[f in foyer]: money EUR at start_of(income_year[f])
  note "§ 20: la somme des plafonds en impôt résultant des demi-parts additionnelles"
  rule base v qf2026 = gen_benefit[f]
  rule with_comp excepts base v qf2026 when fr_comp_order = example = gen_benefit[f] + comp_cap[f]

def capped[f in foyer]: bool at start_of(income_year[f])
  note "§ 20: si le premier terme est inférieur au second, le plafonnement est applicable"
  rule base v qf2026 = first_term[f] < second_term[f]

def comp_cap[f in foyer]: money EUR at start_of(income_year[f])
  note "§ 150: la réduction complémentaire ne peut excéder le montant du quatrième alinéa du 2 du I de l'article 197 du CGI"
  rule base v qf2026 = cap_comp * comp_halves[f]

def comp_reduction[f in foyer]: money EUR at start_of(income_year[f])
  note "§ 140: la différence entre l'impôt avant plafonnement et l'impôt après plafonnement, nulle sans plafonnement; § 150 cap"
  rule base v qf2026 = min(comp_cap[f], max(0, second_term[f] - first_term[f]))
  rule in_benefit excepts base when fr_comp_order = example = 0

def eigenbedarf: money EUR
  note "Notwendiger Eigenbedarf (Selbstbehalt) of U, Anm. A.VII"
  rule base v dt2026 = selbstbehalt[dt_u_work]

def einsatz[c in child]: money EUR
  note "Teil C: der Einsatzbetrag für den Kindesunterhalt entspricht dem Zahlbetrag"
  rule base v dt2026 = zahlbetrag[dt_group(income), dt_age(child_age[c])]

def einsatz_sum: money EUR = sum(c in child where first_rank[c]: einsatz[c])

def extra_halves[f in foyer]: num at start_of(income_year[f])
  note "§ 40: les demi-parts supplémentaires soumises au plafonnement, au-delà des parts de base"
  rule base v qf2026 = (parts[f] - base_parts) * 2

def first_rank[c in child]: bool
  note "§ 1609 Nr. 1 BGB: minderjährige Kinder und Kinder im Sinne des § 1603 Abs. 2 Satz 2"
  rule base v bgb_2026 = child_age[c] < 18
  rule privileged excepts base v bgb_2026 when child_age[c] >= 18 = unmarried[c] and child_age[c] < 21 and lives_with_parent[c] and in_school[c]

def first_term[f in foyer]: money EUR at start_of(income_year[f]) = tax[f]

def friend_person[i in friend]: key person
  note "the composition: friend 0 is U, friend 1 is E, friends 2 and 3 are the French spouses in an order it does not give"
  rule base = friend_of[cmp_spouses, i]

def gen_benefit[f in foyer]: money EUR at start_of(income_year[f])
  note "§ 40: plafond par demi-part supplémentaire"
  rule base v qf2026 = round(cap_half * extra_halves[f], 1, half-up)

def maint_pln[c in child]: money PLN
  note "question 1: each child's maintenance at the NBP rate, half up to the grosz, as the question sets"
  rule base = round(unterhalt[c] * eur_pln, 0.01, half-up)

def maint_pln_diff: money PLN = maint_pln_sum - maint_pln_once

def maint_pln_once: money PLN
  note "question 1: the total maintenance in euros, converted at once and rounded the same way"
  rule base = round(sum(c in child: unterhalt[c]) * eur_pln, 0.01, half-up)

def maint_pln_sum: money PLN = sum(c in child: maint_pln[c])

def mangelfall: bool
  note "Teil C: das Einkommen reicht zur Deckung des Bedarfs gleichrangiger Unterhaltsberechtigter nicht aus"
  rule base v dt2026 = masse < einsatz_sum

def masse: money EUR
  note "Verteilungsmasse: Einkommen nach Abzug des notwendigen Eigenbedarfs"
  rule base v dt2026 = max(0, income - eigenbedarf)

def net_flow[p in person]: money PLN
  note "questions 4 and 5: the person's flows in the month, in złoty: the złoty account, plus the euro account converted movement by movement at the NBP rate, half up to the grosz (LANGUAGE §5.13.3). No pay reaches it, so it may read flows (§5.13.1)."
  rule base = flows(pln[p], flow_month) + (flows(eur[p], flow_month) in PLN at eur_pln half-up)

def owed_total[j in friend]: money PLN
  note "(6): r j, the total friend j is owed"
  rule base v verhoeff_2004 = sum(k in friend where k != j: owe[k, j])

def owes_total[i in friend]: money PLN
  note "(5): p i, the total friend i owes"
  rule base v verhoeff_2004 = sum(k in friend where k != i: owe[i, k])

def part_tax[f in foyer]: num EUR at start_of(income_year[f])
  note "BOI-IR-LIQ-20-10 § 1 (CGI art. 193): le barème s'applique au quotient, tranche par tranche"
  rule base v bareme2025 = marginal(bareme, qf[f])

def payer_outflow: money PLN
  note "question 4: U's maintenance converted payment by payment, plus U's net balance from the debts (positive: U must pay)"
  rule base = maint_pln_sum + adult_balance[de_u]

def qf[f in foyer]: num EUR at start_of(income_year[f])
  note "BOI-IR-LIQ-20-10 § 1: le revenu net imposable est divisé par le nombre de parts"
  rule base v bareme2025 = fr_income[f] / parts[f]

def second_term[f in foyer]: money EUR at start_of(income_year[f])
  note "§ 20: l'impôt calculé sur deux parts pour un couple marié soumis à imposition commune, diminué de la somme des plafonds"
  rule base v qf2026 = tax[f] as if {parts[f] = base_parts} - benefit[f]

def tax[f in foyer]: money EUR at start_of(income_year[f])
  note "BOI-IR-LIQ-20-10 § 10 and BOI-IR-LIQ-20-20-40 § 50: à l'euro le plus proche, 0,50 compté pour 1"
  rule base v arrondi2018 = round(tax_raw[f], 1, half-up)

def tax_due[f in foyer]: money EUR at start_of(income_year[f])
  note "§ 20: l'impôt à retenir; § 170: la réduction complémentaire vient en diminution de la cotisation après plafonnement"
  rule base v qf2026 = (if capped[f] then second_term[f] else first_term[f]) - comp_reduction[f]

def tax_due_pln: money PLN
  note "question 2: the French tax due at the NBP rate, half up to the grosz"
  rule base = round(tax_due[ex40] * eur_pln, 0.01, half-up)

def tax_raw[f in foyer]: num EUR at start_of(income_year[f])
  note "BOI-IR-LIQ-20-10 § 1: le chiffre obtenu est multiplié par le nombre de parts"
  rule base v bareme2025 = part_tax[f] * parts[f]

def unterhalt[c in child]: money EUR
  note "Teil C: im Mangelfall wird die Verteilungsmasse im Verhältnis der Einsatzbeträge verteilt"
  rule base v dt2026 = einsatz[c]
  rule cut_largest excepts base v dt2026 when mangelfall and first_rank[c] and dt_cut_round = largest_rem = prorata(masse, einsatz[j] for j in child where first_rank[j], c, 0.01, rest largest)
  rule cut_nearest excepts base v dt2026 when mangelfall and first_rank[c] and dt_cut_round = nearest = prorata(masse, einsatz[j] for j in child where first_rank[j], c, 0.01, half-up, rest none)
  rule second excepts base when not first_rank[c] = ? "Nachrangige Kinder (§ 1609 Nr. 4 BGB) sind in diesem Modell nicht beschrieben."

def zahlbetrag[g in incgroup, a in agegroup]: money EUR
  note "Anhang page 6: Tabellenbetrag nach Abzug des Kindergeldanteils (hälftig bei Minderjährigen, voll bei Volljährigen), § 1612b Abs. 1 BGB"
  rule adult excepts base v dt2026 when a = a18 = dt_amount[g, a] - kindergeld
  rule base v dt2026 = dt_amount[g, a] - round(kindergeld / 2, 0.01, half-up)

pay debt_pay[i in friend, j in friend where j != i]
  from pln[friend_person[i]]
  to pln[friend_person[j]]
  amount owe[i, j]
  on debts_on

pay maint[c in child]
  from eur[de_u]
  to eur[child_person[c]]
  amount unterhalt[c]
  on maint_on

ask q_balance: balance[i] for i in friend

ask q_balance_sum: balance_sum

ask q_benefit: benefit[f] for f in foyer

ask q_brochure_2parts: check tax[ex40] as if {parts[ex40] = base_parts} = brochure_row[p2]

ask q_brochure_5parts: check tax_due[ex40] = brochure_row[p5]

ask q_c1_maint_pln: maint_pln[c] for c in child

ask q_c1_totals: maint_pln_sum, maint_pln_once, maint_pln_diff

ask q_c2_tax_pln: tax_due_pln

ask q_c3_adults: adult_owes[p], adult_owed[p], adult_balance[p] for p in [de_u, de_e, fr_a, fr_b]

ask q_c3_friends: friend_person[i] for i in friend

ask q_c4_flows_check: check -net_flow[de_u] = payer_outflow

ask q_c4_outflow: payer_outflow

ask q_c5_net: net_flow[p] for p in person

ask q_c5_sum: sum(p in person: net_flow[p])

ask q_c6_b0: inputs-of balance[f0]

ask q_c6_b1: inputs-of balance[f1]

ask q_c6_b2: inputs-of balance[f2]

ask q_c6_b3: inputs-of balance[f3]

ask q_c6_k1: inputs-of unterhalt[k1]

ask q_c6_k2: inputs-of unterhalt[k2]

ask q_c6_k3: inputs-of unterhalt[k3]

ask q_c6_tax: inputs-of tax_due[ex40]

ask q_capped: capped[f] for f in foyer

ask q_eigenbedarf: eigenbedarf

ask q_einsatz: einsatz[c] for c in child

ask q_einsatz_sum: einsatz_sum

ask q_extra_halves: extra_halves[f] for f in foyer

ask q_kindergeld_check: check kindergeld = estg_kindergeld

ask q_masse: masse

ask q_minuhv_check: check dt_amount[g1, a] = minuhv_amount[a] for a in [a0_5, a6_11, a12_17]

ask q_nbp_table_check: check eur_pln = eur_pln_table

ask q_nbp_xml_check: check eur_pln = eur_pln_xml

ask q_owed: owed_total[j] for j in friend

ask q_owes: owes_total[i] for i in friend

ask q_qf: qf[f], qf[f] as if {parts[f] = base_parts} for f in foyer

ask q_second_term: second_term[f] for f in foyer

ask q_split_check: check sum(c in child: unterhalt[c]) = masse

ask q_tax: tax[f], tax[f] as if {parts[f] = base_parts} for f in foyer

ask q_tax_due: tax_due[f] for f in foyer

ask q_tax_raw: tax_raw[f], tax_raw[f] as if {parts[f] = base_parts} for f in foyer

ask q_unterhalt: unterhalt[c] for c in child

ask q_zahlbetrag: zahlbetrag[g1, a] for a in agegroup

version verhoeff_2004
  cite verhoeff
  known 2004-04-15
  note "Article page: Pub. online: 15 April 2004, the source's own date. The rules (5), (6) and (8) cite this version."

version bgb_2026
  cite bgb
  known 2017-07-21
  note "§ 1609 Nr. 1 BGB in the wording of the Gesetz zur Änderung des Unterhaltsrechts of 21.12.2007 (BGBl. I Nr. 69 of 28.12.2007, S. 3189); § 1603 Abs. 2 Satz 2 BGB in the wording of the Gesetz zur Bekämpfung von Kinderehen of 17.07.2017 (BGBl. I Nr. 48 of 21.07.2017, S. 2429; lexetius.com/BGB/1603, Anm. 5-6)"
  note "Known from the later promulgation, 21.07.2017, since the rules of first_rank read both provisions. The rank rules cite this version."

version arrondi2018
  cite boi_liq_20_20_40
  known 2018-07-04
  note "IV. Règles d'arrondissement, § 50; the rounding rule of tax cites this version. Known from the BOI's own date, version du 04/07/2018."

version minuhv_2026
  cite muvaendv_7
  governs 2026-01..
  known 2024-11-21
  note "Law, known from its publication: the Siebte Verordnung zur Änderung der Mindestunterhaltsverordnung of 15.11.2024, BGBl. 2024 I Nr. 359 of 21.11.2024 (recht.bund.de), which sets the amounts ab dem 1. Januar 2026. The locators are the consolidated § 1, which is not the rows' version (LANGUAGE §5.3). MinUhV covers the three age stages of minors only."
  minuhv_amount[a0_5] = 486 "§ 1 Nr. 1: 486 Euro ab dem 1. Januar 2026"
  minuhv_amount[a6_11] = 558 "§ 1 Nr. 2: 558 Euro ab dem 1. Januar 2026"
  minuhv_amount[a12_17] = 653 "§ 1 Nr. 3: 653 Euro ab dem 1. Januar 2026"

version estg66
  cite stefeg
  known 2024-12-30
  note "Law, known from its publication: the Steuerfortentwicklungsgesetz of 23.12.2024, BGBl. 2024 I Nr. 449, ausgegeben am 30.12.2024 (recht.bund.de); its Art. 2 sets § 66 Abs. 1 EStG at 259 Euro from 1 January 2026. The locator is the consolidated § 66, which is not the row's version (LANGUAGE §5.3)."
  estg_kindergeld = 259 governs 2026 "§ 66 Abs. 1: Das Kindergeld beträgt monatlich für jedes Kind 259 Euro."

version dt2026
  cite olg_dt2026
  governs 2026-01..
  known 2025-12-01
  note "Known from its publication: press release of the OLG Düsseldorf of 1 December 2025 (justiz.nrw/node/6813), the table ab sofort auf der Internetseite abrufbar. The PDF's own stamps (created 25 Nov, modified 28 Nov 2025) are before it."
  dt_age: [0, 5] = a0_5 "page 1, table heading, Altersstufe 0-5"
  dt_age: [6, 11] = a6_11 "page 1, table heading, Altersstufe 6 - 11"
  dt_age: [12, 17] = a12_17 "page 1, table heading, Altersstufe 12 - 17"
  dt_age: [18, inf) = a18 "page 1, table heading, ab 18"
  dt_amount[g1, a0_5] = 486 "page 1, row 1, 0-5"
  dt_amount[g1, a6_11] = 558 "page 1, row 1, 6 - 11"
  dt_amount[g1, a12_17] = 653 "page 1, row 1, 12 - 17"
  dt_amount[g1, a18] = 698 "page 1, row 1, ab 18"
  dt_amount[g2, a0_5] = 511 "page 1, row 2, 0-5"
  dt_amount[g2, a6_11] = 586 "page 1, row 2, 6 - 11"
  dt_amount[g2, a12_17] = 686 "page 1, row 2, 12 - 17"
  dt_amount[g2, a18] = 733 "page 1, row 2, ab 18"
  dt_amount[g3, a0_5] = 535 "page 1, row 3, 0-5"
  dt_amount[g3, a6_11] = 614 "page 1, row 3, 6 - 11"
